# Hullbreacher (Bot1's) replaces each of an opponent's draws on its own (CR 121.6, 614.1a), like any effect that replaces "a
# card" drawn, so it is ordered with the drawing player's own replacement effects by that player (CR 616.1). Bot2 draws its
# last card in its turn 2 draw step (exempt from Hullbreacher), then casts Laboratory Maniac and Ancestral Recall. The first
# draw would be from its empty library, and both effects apply: Bot2 has Laboratory Maniac apply first and wins the game
# instead of drawing (CR 104.2b); Bot1 gets no Treasure.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Hullbreacher
Plains x4
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Laboratory Maniac
Ancestral Recall
Swamp x3
Swamp

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Hullbreacher.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Library.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Laboratory Maniac.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot2)
Bot2.Replace(Laboratory Maniac)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Hullbreacher
